QZeta3/Cost/Cyclo.lean is adapted from lean_lucasu (LucasU/Cost/Cyclo.lean), which generalises lean_fibzeta
(FibZeta/Cost/Cyclo.lean), which in turn adapts the Lean formalisation QZeta3 in
https://github.com/uplift-universal-inc/qzeta_3-irrationality (directory lean/, Apache License 2.0,
Lean formalisation by F. Solomon Admasu, v0.1.0, 2026-10-11). The file says so in its header and states what was
changed.

Note: this project's library is also called QZeta3 (for the q-analogue of ζ(3)); it is a different formalisation
(a different theorem: √d·ζ_q(3) ∉ ℚ at real quadratic units q of norm +1), not a fork of the uplift repository.
